Small sample size

#+BEGIN_QUOTE
We demonstrate that daily AIH 1
hand opening practice enhances hand function in
persons with chronic cSCI, extending earlier reports
of improved respiratory function in rodents2 and leg
function in humans.
#+END_QUOTE

#+BEGIN_QUOTE
Repetitive
AIH may elicit synergistic benefits with AIH 1
task-specific training after SCI.
#+END_QUOTE

#+BEGIN_QUOTE
We hypothesize that AIH 1
task-specific training also may result in beneficial
BDNF/TrkB signaling in humans; however, this
possibility remains unknown.
